    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to no. 59 Cluain Craoibh, a bright and spacious 2-bedroom terrace house located on a quiet Cul de sac in the heart of Kinnegad and easy access to M4 & M6. It lies within walking distance of the national primary school and local amenities including a selection of local shops, pubs, Tesco, Eurospar, Post Office, creches, new library, new playground and is a key location for access for travelling to Dublin on the N4, Mullingar & Athlone.\n\nOn entering the house, a hallway with tiled flooring and carpet stairs. Off the hallway is a generous sized sitting room with timber flooring and wood surround fireplace with open fire, double doors leading to kitchen/dining area. The kitchen/dining room has fitted units with tiled flooring, cooker, hob, extractor fan, washing machine & fridge included. French doors lead to the mature Southwest facing back garden.\n\nUpstairs are 2 bedrooms with generous fitted wardrobes. The family bathroom is partially tiled with wc, whb, and panel bath. The house is deceptively spacious and bright throughout and would make a great investment opportunity or first home. \n\nViewing comes highly recommended\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance Hall Hardwood front door, tiled flooring, carpet stairs and alarm panel\n\nLiving Room 6m x 2.65m (19'8\" x 8'8\"): Bay window, laminate flooring, timber surround fireplace with open fire, double doors leading to kitchen area.\n\nKitchen/dining room 4.1m x 3.4m (13'5\" x 11'2\"): Fully fitted kitchen with tiled flooring, patio doors. Kitchen appliances included. Guest WC.\n\nGuest WC 1.5m x 1.5m (4'11\" x 4'11\"): Tiled flooring, wash hand basin, WC and storage\n\nLanding Carpet and access to attic\n\nBedroom one 4.1m x 3.8m (13'5\" x 12'6\"): Double front aspect, carpet and built in wardrobes\n\nBedroom Two 3.3m x 3.5m (10'10\" x 11'6\"): Laminate flooring, built in wardrobes and hot press\n\nFamily Bathroom Partially tiled bathroom with bath, screen door, wash hand basin and WC.\n\nSpecial Features & Services\n•Gfch\n•All kitchen appliances included\n•Approx 837 sq ft\n•Alarmed\n•Parking \n•Garden shed\n•Overlooking green area\n•Close to all local amenities\n•Close to M4 & M6\n•Bus route \n•National Primary school"
      },
